Exceptions (third-party data, under their own licences):
- register/places/au-*.json: suburb names from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/),
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/),
  converted by https://github.com/zauberware/postal-codes-json-xml-csv.
- register/places/nz.json and nz-lines.json: built from Open NZ Postcodes
  (https://github.com/s01ipsist/open_nz_postcodes), CC0 1.0, and GeoNames as above.
  The lines company for each postcode is wattle's own work.
